From 89594e426f3153e912a9310489e1e09878cf863d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: csolomon <charliesolomon@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 13:17:37 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] deps: shell-quote 1.10.0 -> 1.12.0 (GHSA-pqg4-j6r4-53mv)

Why a patch: this is a change to upstream's lockfile, which no
policy-pack extension can express. Upstream v1.0.4 resolves shell-quote
1.10.0; retire this patch at the first sync whose upstream lockfile
resolves >= 1.11.0, the first fixed version.

What: GHSA-pqg4-j6r4-53mv (critical, published 2026-10-06) is a command
injection in shell-quote's quote() for versions >= 1.8.4 < 1.11.0.
shell-quote reaches vendor/pi only through upstream's `sandbox` example
extension (@anthropic-ai/sandbox-runtime), a workspace of the monorepo
that GAH never builds, bundles or loads: the coding-agent dependency
tree has no copy, and the install-lock lockfile scans clean. Trivy
scans the root lockfile regardless, and a fixed version exists, so
ignore-unfixed does not apply; main's next CI run fails on it.

Lockfile only: one entry, version, resolved URL and integrity (checked
against the registry). sandbox-runtime's range already admits 1.12.0;
no manifest changes. Made with `npm update shell-quote
--package-lock-only --ignore-scripts`, which took the newest release.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WHU6GR6xxBMmQZUcB1KhgK
---
 package-lock.json | 6 +++---
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/package-lock.json b/package-lock.json
index b40cd88da..d7d783584 100644
--- a/package-lock.json
+++ b/package-lock.json
@@ -4536,9 +4536,9 @@
 			}
 		},
 		"node_modules/shell-quote": {
-			"version": "1.10.0",
-			"resolved": "https://registry.npmjs.org/shell-quote/-/shell-quote-1.10.0.tgz",
-			"integrity": "sha512-w1aiOKwKuRgtwAReIIj89puqg+I7GvX4IbLrvmhXbzQsj1+Zwi4VO3+fa6ZF91TWSjIxoEkKnMeHcLEODK5ZXA==",
+			"version": "1.12.0",
+			"resolved": "https://registry.npmjs.org/shell-quote/-/shell-quote-1.12.0.tgz",
+			"integrity": "sha512-PcByqNyT/38F2kDNi006HAMRJaULuBzq/FOsw3qdZvX/GA9W/jamDaRskgHjubHiftXK5sIFxLNkvrXUwcof6Q==",
